        "collective": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Founders</h3><p>Penya was co-founded by Andrew Gotora, an engineer based in Heidelberg, Germany, and Courtney Matende, a journalist and former model based in Zimbabwe. Andrew is an Afrika Kommt fellow and the founder of Diaspora Unlocked — a platform connecting Zimbabwean farmers, businesses, and entrepreneurs to international opportunities and investors. Courtney is a former Miss Gweru and a journalist who has spent her career telling African stories with depth and care. Together, they built Penya with a simple mandate: to make African creatives shine.</p>",
